[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m # --- enumerate declared features (excluding "default") ----------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m mapfile -t FEATURES < <(
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   awk '
